  },
  {
    "bookId": 13,
    "chapterId": 2,
    "verseId": 31,
    "text": "亚遍{H649}的儿子{H1121}是以示{H3469}；以示{H3469}的儿子{H1121}是示珊{H8348}；示珊{H8348}的儿子{H1121}是亚来{H304}。"
  },
  {
    "bookId": 13,
    "chapterId": 2,
    "verseId": 32,
